                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJc3yInFapQjQRtBc1qSDHY7s/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQNC1paUtBEAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Follow us on Instagram: @karenfu_food for more delicious food ฅ^•ﻌ•^ฅ\n\n-\nA Japanese restaurant hidden in an alley 🍣\n\nA group trip here is definitely worth it! You can try so many dishes. Highly recommended are the caterpillar sushi, raw beef salad, Matsusaka pork sikyo-yaki, and pumpkin croquettes. The caterpillar sushi has perfectly seasoned vinegared rice and shrimp, making it very refreshing. The seared beef, with its Maillard reaction and the addition of scallions and purple onions, has a richer flavor and isn\u0027t greasy even after eating a lot!\n\nThe Matsusaka pork is marinated in miso beforehand, but it\u0027s not too salty. The searing method preserves the tender meat, making it perfect with rice or drinks. The pumpkin croquettes are a must-try for pumpkin lovers; the smooth pumpkin puree filling and light batter are excellent! 🏷️Prawn Caterpillar Sushi: NT$430\n\n🏷Raw Beef Salad: NT$480\n\n🏷️Matsusaka Pork Saikyo-yaki: NT$280\n\n🏷️Tender Karaage Chicken: NT$180\n\n🏷️Pumpkin Croquette/each: NT$150\n\n🏷️Shrimp Tempura: NT$260\n\n🏷️Vegetable Tempura: NT$160\n\n🏷️Sashimi: NT$380\n\n🏷️Tekka Roll: NT$100\n\n🏷️Shrimp Hand Roll: NT$60\n\n🏷️Asparagus Hand Roll: NT$60\n\n🏷️Seafood Udon Noodles: NT$180\n\n🏷️Salmon Fried Rice: NT$170\n\n🐈‍⬛ The overall decor is very grand, especially the bar area. In addition to the items on the menu, there is also a blackboard with the recommended dishes for the day!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "歡迎追蹤Instagram: @karenfu_food\n看更多美食ฅ^•ﻌ•^ฅ\n-\n\n藏身於巷弄中的日料🍣\n\n揪團來吃絕對不虧，可以吃超多道料理，最推薦毛毛蟲壽司、生牛肉沙拉、松阪豬西京燒、南瓜可麗餅。毛毛蟲壽司的醋飯餡料及蝦子調味恰到好處，吃起來很清爽；炙燒的牛肉，梅納反應再搭配蔥花、紫洋蔥，口感更豐富，吃多也不膩！\n\n松阪豬有先用味噌醃過，但不會過鹹，炙燒的手法，保有軟嫩的肉質，下飯配酒都合適；南瓜可樂餅，南瓜控一定要點，細緻的南瓜泥內餡，沒有過厚的麵衣，推推！\n\n🏷️明蝦毛毛蟲壽司：NT$430\n🏷生牛肉沙拉：NT$480\n️🏷️松阪豬西京燒：NT$280\n🏷️嫩唐揚雞：NT$180\n🏷️南瓜可樂餅/個：NT$150\n🏷️海老天婦羅：NT$260\n🏷️野菜天婦羅：NT$160\n🏷️盛和刺身：NT$380\n🏷️鐵火捲：NT$100\n🏷️蝦手捲：NT$60\n🏷️蘆筍手捲：NT$60\n🏷️海鮮烏龍麵：NT$180\n🏷️鮭魚炒飯：NT$170\n\n🐈‍⬛ 整體裝潢很氣派，尤其是吧台區，除了菜單上的品項，小黑板也有當日推薦菜色可以參考哦！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
